arrey","description":"This is an all-levels yoga flow for beginners to experts that will help you build strength and mobility. The vinyasa flow is set to the beat of the latest top 40 and throwback favorites. The last portion of class will be all about opening the body and increasing mobility.  Each class will end with a [&hellip;]","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","inLanguage":"en-US","@id":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/events\/slow-flow-with-stephanie-mccarrey-3-2\/2026-07-01\/#primaryimage","url":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/Screenshot-2025-03-04-160746.jpg","contentUrl":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/Screenshot-2025-03-04-160746.jpg","width":1397,"height":1088},"url":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/events\/slow-flow-with-stephanie-mccarrey-3-2\/2026-07-01\/","eventAttendanceMode":"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode","eventStatus":"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled","startDate":"2026-07-01T19:00:00-05:00","endDate":"2026-07-01T20:00:00-05:00","@id":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/events\/slow-flow-with-stephanie-mccarrey-3-2\/2026-07-01\/#event"},{"@type":"Event","name":"Children’s Bingo","description":"Bring the kiddos and join our Levy Park team for Children’s Bingo! This 30-minute program, ideal for kids aged 4 to 12, is a fun way for children to practice their letters and numbers while earning prizes. Levy Park provides Bingo cards, markers, and prizes. B-I-N-G-O!","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","inLanguage":"en-US","@id":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/events\/childrens-bingo\/2026-07-02\/#primaryimage","url":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/DSC09097.jpg","contentUrl":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/DSC09097.jpg","width":2048,"height":1366},"url":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/events\/childrens-bingo\/2026-07-02\/","eventAttendanceMode":"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanc