-therapy-texas-sound-2\/2026-07-07\/","eventAttendanceMode":"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode","eventStatus":"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled","startDate":"2026-07-07T19:00:00-05:00","endDate":"2026-07-07T20:00:00-05:00","@id":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/events\/sound-therapy-texas-sound-2\/2026-07-07\/#event"},{"@type":"Event","name":"Japan Junction","description":"The Japan-America Society of Houston (JASH) is the leading organization that connects Houston’s diverse community, local businesses, and individuals to advance the mutual interest of American and Japanese peoples.  ","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","inLanguage":"en-US","@id":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/events\/japan-junction-3-2-2-2\/2026-07-08\/#primaryimage","url":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/June-06.03.jpg","contentUrl":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/June-06.03.jpg","width":1280,"height":1280},"url":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/events\/japan-junction-3-2-2-2\/2026-07-08\/","eventAttendanceMode":"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode","eventStatus":"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled","startDate":"2026-07-08T16:30:00-05:00","endDate":"2026-07-08T17:30:00-05:00","location":{"@type":"Place","name":"Levy Park (Event Pavilion)","description":"","url":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/venue\/levy-park-event-pavilion\/","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressRegion":"TX"},"telephone":"","sameAs":""},"@id":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/events\/japan-junction-3-2-2-2\/2026-07-08\/#event"},{"@type":"Event","name":"Bollywood &#038; Bhangra Dance","description":"This vibrant and entertaining fitness dance class is suitable for all ability levels. It gives a whole-body workout while dancing to the rhythm of joy with the powerful nature of Bollywood and Bhangra Music.","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","inLanguage":"en-US","@id":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/events\/bollywood-bhangra-dance-2-2-4-2\/2026-07-08\/#primaryimage","url":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/DSC0443_DxO.jpg","contentUrl":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/DSC0443_DxO.jpg","width":2048,"height":1366},"url":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/events\/bollywood-bhangra-dance-2-2-4-2\/2026-07-08\/","eventAttendanceMode":"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode","eventStatus":"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled","startDate":"2026-07-08T18:00:00-05:00","endDate":"2026-07-08T19:00:00-05:00","location":{"@type":"Place","name":"Levy Park (Event Pavilion)","description":"","url":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/venue\/levy-park-event-pavilion\/","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressRegion":"TX"},"telephone":"","sameAs":""},"@id":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/events\/bollywood-bhangra-dance-2-2-4-2\/2026-07-08\/#event"},{"@type":"Event","name":"Slow Flow with Stephanie McCarrey","description":"This is an all-levels yoga flow for beginners to experts that will help you build strength and mobility. The vinyasa flow is set to the beat of the latest top 40 and throwback favorites. The last portion of class will be all about opening the body and increasing mobility.  Each class will end with a [&hellip;]","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","inLanguage":"en-US","@id":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/events\/slow-flow-with-stephanie-mccarrey-3-2\/2026-07-08\/#primaryimage","url":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/Screenshot-2025-03-04-160746.jpg","contentUrl":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/Screenshot-2025-03-04-160746.jpg","width":1397,"height":1088},"url":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/events\/slow-flow-with-stephanie-mccarrey-3-2\/2026-07-08\/","eventAttendanceMode":"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode","eventStatus":"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled","startDate":"2026-07-08T19:00:00-05:00","endDate":"2026-07-08T20:00:00-05:00","@id":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/events\/slow-flow-with-stephanie-mccarrey-3-2\/2026-07-08\/#event"},{"@type":"Event","name":"Free Watch Party: France vs Morocco","description":"The group stage drama is behind us — now it&#8217;s pure knockout soccer. Eight teams left standing, and tonight France and Morocco go to war for a spot in the semifinals. Come feel the electricity. Kickoff is at 3:00 p.m. Admission is free! Food and Beverage Concessions: Visit Franky&#8217;s for a gourmet hot dog or sausage, [&hellip;]","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","inLanguage":"en-US","@id":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/events\/quarterfinals-day-1\/#primaryimage","url":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/I63A4660-scaled.jpg","contentUrl":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/I63A4660-scaled.jpg","width":2560,"height":1707},"url":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/events\/quarterfinals-day-1\/","eventAttendanceMode":"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode","eventStatus":"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled","startDate":"2026-07-09T13:30:00-05:00","endDate":"2026-07-09T18:30:00-05:00","@id":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/events\/quarterfinals-day-1\/#event"},{"@type":"Event","name":"Children’s Bingo","description":"Bring the kiddos and join our Levy Park team for Children’s Bingo! This 30-minute program, ideal for kids aged 4 to 12, is a fun way for children to practice their letters and numbers while earning prizes. Levy Park provides Bingo cards, markers, and prizes. B-I-N-G-O!","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","inLanguage":"en-US","@id":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/events\/childrens-bingo\/2026-07-09\/#primaryimage","url":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/DSC09097.jpg","contentUrl":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/DSC09097.jpg","width":2048,"height":1366},"url":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/events\/childrens-bingo\/2026-07-09\/","eventAttendanceMode":"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode","eventStatus":"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled","startDate":"2026-07-09T16:30:00-05:00","endDate":"2026-07-09T17:00:00-05:00","@id":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/events\/childrens-bingo\/2026-07-09\/#event"},{"@type":"Event","name":"Blue Dragon Tai Chi","description":"Join us at Levy Park with Taoist Healing for Tai Chi and Meditation every Friday at 9 AM and every Thursday 6 PM. Practice Tai Chi to connect and focus the body and mind with slow, low-impact gentle movements and stretches. Open to all ages and levels, this class is great for those who want to de-stress, find their inner peace, and increase overall health.","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","inLanguage":"en-US","@id":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/events\/blue-dragon-tai-chi-2-3\/2026-07-09\/#primaryimage","url":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/11\/2021-09-24_tai_chi_and_swords_-_1964.jpeg","contentUrl":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/11\/2021-09-24_tai_chi_and_swords_-_1964.jpeg","width":2048,"height":1365,"caption":"Join us at Levy Park with Taoist Healing for Tai Chi and Meditation every Friday at 9 AM and every Thursday 6 PM."},"url":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/events\/blue-dragon-tai-chi-2-3\/2026-07-09\/","eventAttendanceMode":"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode","eventStatus":"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled","startDate":"2026-07-09T18:00:00-05:00","endDate":"2026-07-09T19:00:00-05:00","location":{"@type":"Place","name":"Levy Park (Event Pavilion)","description":"","url":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/venue\/levy-park-event-pavilion\/","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressRegion":"TX"},"telephone":"","sameAs":""},"@id":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/events\/blue-dragon-tai-chi-2-3\/2026-07-09\/#event"},{"@type":"Event","name":"Slow Flow with Stephanie McCarrey","description":"This is an all-levels yoga flow for beginners to experts that will help you build strength and mobility. The vinyasa flow is set to the beat of the latest top 40 and throwback favorites. The last portion of class will be all about opening the body and increasing mobility.  Each class will end with a [&hellip;]","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","inLanguage":"en-US","@id":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/events\/slow-flow-yoga-with-stephanie-mccarrey-2-2\/2026-07-10\/#primaryimage","url":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/2022-09-16-Slow-Flow-0196.jpg","contentUrl":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/2022-09-16-Slow-Flow-0196.jpg","width":2048,"height":1366},"url":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/events\/slow-flow-yoga-with-stephanie-mccarrey-2-2\/2026-07-10\/","eventAttendanceMode":"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode","eventStatus":"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled","startDate":"2026-07-10T08:00:00-05:00","endDate":"2026-07-10T09:00:00-05:00","@id":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/events\/slow-flow-yoga-with-stephanie-mccarrey-2-2\/2026-07-10\/#event"},{"@type":"Event","name":"Blue Dragon Tai Chi","description":"Join us at Levy Park with Taoist Healing for Tai Chi and Meditation every Thursday at 7 pm and Friday at 9 am. Practice Tai Chi to connect and focus the body and mind with slow, low-impact gentle movements and stretches. Open to all ages and levels, this class is great for those who want to de-stress, find their inner peace, and increase overall health. ","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","inLanguage":"en-US","@id":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/events\/blue-dragon-tai-chi-2-2\/2026-07-10\/#primaryimage","url":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/11\/2021-09-24_tai_chi_and_swords_-_1964.jpeg","contentUrl":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/11\/2021-09-24_tai_chi_and_swords_-_1964.jpeg","width":2048,"height":1365,"caption":"Join us at Levy Park with Taoist Healing for Tai Chi and Meditation every Friday at 9 AM and every Thursday 6 PM."},"url":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/events\/blue-dragon-tai-chi-2-2\/2026-07-10\/","eventAttendanceMode":"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode","eventStatus":"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled","startDate":"2026-07-10T09:00:00-05:00","endDate":"2026-07-10T10:00:00-05:00","location":{"@type":"Place","name":"Levy Park (Event Pavilion)","description":"","url":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/venue\/levy-park-event-pavilion\/","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressRegion":"TX"},"telephone":"","sameAs":""},"@id":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/events\/blue-dragon-tai-chi-2-2\/2026-07-10\/#event"},{"@type":"Event","name":"Free Watch Party: Belgium vs Spain","description":"Yesterday, someone&#8217;s dream ended. Tonight, Belgium and Spain leave everything on the pitch for a chance to write their name in World Cup history. We&#8217;ll be watching — will you? Kickoff is at 2:00 p.m. Admission is free! Food and Beverage Concessions: Visit Franky&#8217;s for a gourmet hot dog or sausage, and cool down with [&hellip;]","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","inLanguage":"en-US","@id":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/events\/quarterfinals-day-2\/#primaryimage","url":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/IMG_4987.jpeg","contentUrl":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/IMG_4987.jpeg","width":2016,"height":1512},"url":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/events\/quarterfinals-day-2\/","eventAttendanceMode":"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode","eventStatus":"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled","startDate":"2026-07-10T12:30:00-05:00","endDate":"2026-07-10T17:30:00-05:00","@id":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/events\/quarterfinals-day-2\/#event"},{"@type":"Event","name":"Sunset Bingo at Levy Park","description":"Bring your crew the second Friday of each month for a fun evening where you can take home fantastic prizes. Set to the backdrop of soulful tunes from DJ Del Sur, Sunset Bingo is a great way to unwind and support Levy Park. All event proceeds directly support the park’s operations and programming. Please note: [&hellip;]","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","inLanguage":"en-US","@id":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/events\/sunset-bingo-at-levy-park\/#primaryimage","url":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/IMG_6110-Edited-scaled.jpg","contentUrl":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/IMG_6110-Edited-scaled.jpg","width":2560,"height":1707},"url":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/events\/sunset-bingo-at-levy-park\/","eventAttendanceMode":"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode","eventStatus":"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled","startDate":"2026-07-10T18:00:00-05:00","endDate":"2026-07-10T21:00:00-05:00","@id":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/events\/sunset-bingo-at-levy-park\/#event"},{"@type":"Event","name":"Bollywood &#038; Bhangra Dance","description":"This vibrant and entertaining fitness dance class is suitable for all ability levels. It gives a whole-body workout while dancing to the rhythm of joy with the powerful nature of Bollywood and Bhangra Music.","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","inLanguage":"en-US","@id":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/events\/bollywood-bhangra-dance-2-2-3\/2026-07-11\/#primaryimage","url":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/DSC0443_DxO.jpg","contentUrl":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/DSC0443_DxO.jpg","width":2048,"height":1366},"url":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/events\/bollywood-bhangra-dance-2-2-3\/2026-07-11\/","eventAttendanceMode":"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode","eventStatus":"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled","startDate":"2026-07-11T10:00:00-05:00","endDate":"2026-07-11T11:00:00-05:00","location":{"@type":"Place","name":"Levy Park (Event Pavilion)","description":"","url":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/venue\/levy-park-event-pavilion\/","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressRegion":"TX"},"telephone":"","sameAs":""},"@id":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/events\/bollywood-bhangra-dance-2-2-3\/2026-07-11\/#event"},{"@type":"Event","name":"Houston Grand Opera- Storybook Opera","description":"Storytelling like you’ve never heard it before takes center stage as an opera singer presents an engaging and enjoyable introduction to opera for students. This program features singing storytellers for 30 minutes of captivating fun! 4\/4 &#8211; Lula the Mighty Griot 5\/2 &#8211; Eyes That Meet at the Corner 6\/6 &#8211; Goldilocks and the 3 Bears [&hellip;]","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","inLanguage":"en-US","@id":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/events\/houston-grand-opera-storybook-opera\/2026-07-11\/#primaryimage","url":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/2023-03-14-Levy-0807.jpg","contentUrl":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/2023-03-14-Levy-0807.jpg","width":2048,"height":1366},"url":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/events\/houston-grand-opera-storybook-opera\/2026-07-11\/","eventAttendanceMode":"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode","eventStatus":"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled","startDate":"2026-07-11T11:00:00-05:00","endDate":"2026-07-11T12:00:00-05:00","@id":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/events\/houston-grand-opera-storybook-opera\/2026-07-11\/#event"},{"@type":"Event","name":"Dance and Move with Young Audiences of Houston","description":"Participants will learn to combine elements in dance, music, and theatre while expressing themselves through creative movement. We will use the fundamentals of dance to focus on story-telling while building skills in self-awareness, social awareness, relationship skills, and responsible decision making.","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","inLanguage":"en-US","@id":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/events\/1907-2\/2026-07-11\/#primaryimage","url":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/IMG_2723-scaled.jpg","contentUrl":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/IMG_2723-scaled.jpg","width":1920,"height":2560},"url":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/events\/1907-2\/2026-07-11\/","eventAttendanceMode":"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode","eventStatus":"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled","startDate":"2026-07-11T13:00:00-05:00","endDate":"2026-07-11T14:00:00-05:00","@id":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/events\/1907-2\/2026-07-11\/#event"},{"@type":"Event","name":"Free Watch Party: Norway vs England (4pm) and Argentina vs Switzerland (8pm)","description":"Three days of quarterfinal madness wrap up tonight, and the stakes couldn&#8217;t be higher. By the final whistle, we&#8217;ll know our four semifinalists. Don&#8217;t miss the moment it all becomes clear. Kickoff for Norway vs England is at 4:00 p.m. Kickoff for Argentina vs Switzerland is at 8:00 p.m. Food &amp; Beverage Concessions: Visit Smalls [&hellip;]","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","inLanguage":"en-US","@id":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/events\/quarterfinals-double-header\/#primaryimage","url":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/I63A4918-scaled.jpg","contentUrl":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/I63A4918-scaled.jpg","width":2560,"height":1707},"url":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/events\/quarterfinals-double-header\/","eventAttendanceMode":"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode","eventStatus":"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled","startDate":"2026-07-11T14:30:00-05:00","endDate":"2026-07-11T23:00:00-05:00","@id":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/events\/quarterfinals-double-header\/#event"},{"@type":"Event","name":"Zumba by Tiny Fitness","description":"Join the party and sweat with Tiny Fitness to rhythms from around the world! This hour-long Zumba fitness class will have you grooving, shaking, and toning to salsa, hip hop, samba, and bhangra beats &#8211; and so many more. Open to all fitness levels and recommended for ages 16+, no equipment needed. Always move to [&hellip;]","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","inLanguage":"en-US","@id":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/events\/zumba-by-tiny-fitness-2-2-2-2\/2026-07-12\/#primaryimage","url":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/R7407478-scaled.jpg","contentUrl":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/R7407478-scaled.jpg","width":1707,"height":2560},"url":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/events\/zumba-by-tiny-fitness-2-2-2-2\/2026-07-12\/","eventAttendanceMode":"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode","eventStatus":"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled","startDate":"2026-07-12T09:00:00-05:00","endDate":"2026-07-12T10:00:00-05:00","@id":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/events\/zumba-by-tiny-fitness-2-2-2-2\/2026-07-12\/#event"},{"@type":"Event","name":"Zumba by Tiny Fitness","description":"Join the party and sweat with Tiny Fitness to rhythms from around the world! This hour-long Zumba fitness class will have you grooving, shaking, and toning to salsa, hip hop, samba, and bhangra beats - and so many more.","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","inLanguage":"en-US","@id":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/events\/zumba-by-tiny-fitness\/2026-07-13\/#primaryimage","url":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/I63A9696.jpg","contentUrl":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/I63A9696.jpg","width":2048,"height":1366},"url":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/events\/zumba-by-tiny-fitness\/2026-07-13\/","eventAttendanceMode":"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode","eventStatus":"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled","startDate":"2026-07-13T18:30:00-05:00","endDate"