 and stretches. Open to all ages and levels, this class is great for those who want to de-stress, find their inner peace, and increase overall health.","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","inLanguage":"en-US","@id":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/events\/blue-dragon-tai-chi-2-3\/2026-07-16\/#primaryimage","url":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/11\/2021-09-24_tai_chi_and_swords_-_1964.jpeg","contentUrl":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/11\/2021-09-24_tai_chi_and_swords_-_1964.jpeg","width":2048,"height":1365,"caption":"Join us at Levy Park with Taoist Healing for Tai Chi and Meditation every Friday at 9 AM and every Thursday 6 PM."},"url":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/events\/blue-dragon-tai-chi-2-3\/2026-07-16\/","eventAttendanceMode":"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode","eventStatus":"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled","startDate":"2026-07-16T18:00:00-05:00","endDate":"2026-07-16T19:00:00-05:00","location":{"@type":"Place","name":"Levy Park (Event Pavilion)","description":"","url":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/venue\/levy-park-event-pavilion\/","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressRegion":"TX"},"telephone":"","sameAs":""},"@id":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/events\/blue-dragon-tai-chi-2-3\/2026-07-16\/#event"},{"@type":"Event","name":"Blue Dragon Tai Chi","description":"Join us at Levy Park with Taoist Healing for Tai Chi and Meditation every Thursday at 7 pm and Friday at 9 am. Practice Tai Chi to connect and focus the body and mind with slow, low-impact gentle movements and stretches. Open to all ages and levels, this class is great for those who want to de-stress, find their inner peace, and increase overall health. ","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","inLanguage":"en-US","@id":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/events\/blue-dragon-tai-chi-2-2\/2026-07-17\/#primaryimage","url":"https:\/\/www.levyparkhouston.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/11\/2021-09-24_tai_chi_and_